  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1501.07 Restoration fee",
  "priorExpiration": "2017-02-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1501.07 \"Restoration fee\" means the fee paid by a licensee to restore his or her license or commercial driver license or registration privileges pursuant to RSA 263:42, V and 261:141, X.\n\nSource. #6702, eff 3-3-98, EXPIRED: 3-3-06\n\nNew. #8785, eff 1-3-07, EXPIRED: 1-3-15\n\nNew. #11172, INTERIM, eff 8-29-16, EXPIRED: 2-25-17\n\nNew. #12212, eff 6-16-17",
